            <fullName>Create_Complaint_Case_179jV000000pbbr</fullName>
            <description>Registers a customer&apos;s complaint as a case for a human colleague. Requires the customer number (format C-1234) and a short description of the problem; the order number (format SO-12345) is optional. Only links the case to an order that belongs to the given customer, and never creates a second open complaint for the same order. Returns caseCreated, caseNumber and a message for the customer. Only call this after the customer has confirmed the complaint.</description>
            <developerName>Create_Complaint_Case_179jV000000pbbr</developerName>
            <invocationTarget>Create_Complaint_Case</invocationTarget>
            <invocationTargetType>flow</invocationTargetType>
